{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段的大号白色文字，粉色强调的“心里又热了起来”和“还能有那样的相处”最容易吸引视线。下面橙色、紫色、绿色的几段大字也都很醒目。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"想起过去曾经有过的亲近，盼望以后还能再次拥有那样的相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"后面经历了重新振作、担心还要等待很久，最后转向不再执着于挽留别人、决定好好过自己的日子。这个最终处境及其与前面情绪变化的关系，第一眼不容易完整抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的大号彩色文字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"独立的文字块较多，缺少一个明确统领全屏的核心入口。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要把回暖、重新振作、担忧和最后的自我安顿拼起来才懂。\",\n    \"最后一块较长，一句话里包含条件、珍惜别人、独自生活和不再委屈自己的几层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "784b35bb-c1b0-4988-a8b4-594ec87fad07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013446133341Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:35:16.761219+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e07173dde8ba995c8848bd38843df399a90d4a469b45ad8c24627869a330a29", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8e